d liquid in snow at end = liq\n# This liquid came from melt but didn't drain\naccumulated_liquid = snaps[-1][:,3].sum()\nprint(f'\\\\nAccumulated liquid: {accumulated_liquid:.1f} mm')\nprint(f'This must = melt - runoff')\nprint(f'melt - runoff = 293.5 - 293.5 = 0.0 mm')\nprint(f'BUT accumulated liquid should be the difference: 293.5 - 293.5 = 0.0 mm')\nprint(f'Actual accumulated liquid from snapshots: {accumulated_liquid:.1f} mm')\n\""},"output":"Total precip from forcing: 90.7 mm\nTotal liquid precip (rain only): > 98% of total\nExpected accumulation = 90.7 mm\n\nSnap shape: (30, 3, 5)\nFinal state: h=[1.03099337e-01 1.25602273e-03 1.00000000e-06], rho=[200.         358.09161954 469.10327599], ice=[0.         0.30439539 0.        ], liq=[2.06198675e+01 1.45375822e-01 2.00000000e-04], T=[272.90263409 213.15       273.15      ]\nSWE from snapshots: 21.1 mm\nFinal ice_mm total: 0.3 mm\nFinal liq_mm total: 20.8 mm\n\nAccumulated liquid: 20.8 mm\nThis must = melt - runoff\nmelt - runoff = 293.5 - 293.5 = 0.0 mm\nBUT accumulated liquid should be the difference: 293.5 - 293.5 = 0.0 mm\nActual accumulated liquid from snapshots: 20.8 mm\n","metadata":{"output":"Total precip from forcing: 90.7 mm\nTotal liquid precip (rain only): > 98% of total\nExpected accumulation = 90.7 mm\n\nSnap shape: (30, 3, 5)\nFinal state: h=[1.03099337e-01 1.25602273e-03 1.00000000e-06], rho=[200.         358.09161954 469.10327599], ice=[0.         0.30439539 0.        ], liq=[2.06198675e+01 1.45375822e-01 2.00000000e-04], T=[272.90263409 213.15       273.15      ]\nSWE from snapshots: 21.1 mm\nFinal ice_mm total: 0.3 mm\nFinal liq_mm total: 20.8 mm\n\nAccumulated liquid: 20.8 mm\nThis must = melt - runoff\nmelt - runoff = 293.5 - 293.5 = 0.0 mm\nBUT accumulated liquid should be the difference: 293.5 - 293.5 = 0.0 mm\nActual accumulated liquid from snapshots: 20.8 mm\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /tmp/data && python3 -c \"\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, '/tmp')\nfrom analysis import 